    <rdfs:comment>One BOQ row extracted from a tender PDF during ingestion. Distinct from &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#BOQItem&gt; (post-award, project-side). Carries &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/tender#ofTender&gt;, &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/tender#needsReview&gt; (L24 hallucination guard), and &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/tender#dedupCount&gt; (5-gram Jaccard collapse).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>Tender BOQ Item</rdfs:label>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/tender"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
