    <rdfs:label>issue type</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Clash / Coordination / Design / Construction / Safety / Other. SHACL constrains via sh:in (string literal, no sh:class — same idiom as DrawingChangeShape).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/coordination"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#transmittalPdfRef">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"/>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Canonical s3:// URI of the auto-generated transmittal PDF (WeasyPrint + Jinja2, V0.36 split). Domain unspecified (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>transmittal PDF ref</rdfs:label>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/transmittalPdfRef"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/procurement#grnNumber">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The grn number property in the integrated project information model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">Editorial definition added for proposed IproK 0.2.0; inspect the retained source and mapping record.</dct:description>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/procurement"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/grnNumber"/>
    <rdfs:label>SAP GRN / material-document number (MBLNR)</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/tender#totalQuoted">
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/totalQuoted"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
    <rdfs:label>total quoted (INR)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Sum of (recommended_rate × estimated_qty) across every matched &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/tender#TenderBOQItem&gt;. The base bid before contingency. Domain-free (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/tender"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/handover#dlpMonths">
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/handover"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label>DLP (months)</rdfs:label>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/dlpMonths"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Defect-liability window in months. RERA default 60 (5 years from possession).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#productOfferForCostResource">
