  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/finance#forUnit">
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/finance"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">for Unit</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/forUnit"/>
    <rdfs:comment>The &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/property#Unit&gt; this receipt pays against. Range left undeclared so RDFS inference never re-classifies referenced IRIs (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#Recovery">
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/Recovery"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:label>Recovery</rdfs:label>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/billing"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A single statutory deduction line item within a &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#RABill&gt;. Each recovery has a type (TDS-IT, GST-TDS, LabourCess, SecurityDeposit, AdvanceRecovery, WaterElectricity, Royalty, Other), a rate (percentage), and a computed amount. Defined in S3.6.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok#User">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok"/>
    <rdfs:label>User</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/User"/>
    <rdfs:comment>An authenticated platform user, such as a site engineer, quality controller or project manager.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/signal#pricePerUnit">
    <rdfs:comment>Current market price in INR per the material's UOM (Steel: per MT; Cement: per bag; Bitumen: per MT).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/pricePerUnit"/>
    <rdfs:label>market price per unit (INR)</rdfs:label>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/signal"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
