  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#itemCode">
    <rdfs:comment>Stable identifier for a checklist row (V0.17 — e.g. 'IS-456-7.4.1') or for a BOQ line (V0.29 — e.g. 'B-01'). Domain intentionally left unspecified — adding `rdfs:domain &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/quality#ChecklistItem&gt;` would make every BOQItem carrying &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#itemCode&gt; get RDFS-inferred as a ChecklistItem and trip ChecklistItemShape (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/itemCode"/>
