    <rdfs:label>purpose</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>ForConstruction / ForReview / ForApproval / ForInformation / AsBuilt / Superseded. SHACL constrains via sh:in (string literal, no sh:class — same idiom as DrawingChangeShape). Domain unspecified (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/document"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/purpose"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#modelRevision">
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/modelRevision"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Project-unique identifier of the IFC upload that produced this element. Plain string — typically a short id minted server-side. Lets a later revision supersede prior elements without losing the audit chain (PROV-O carries the activity). Polymorphic — carried on &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/building#Element&gt; and &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/building#IfcModel&gt;.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>model revision</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/cost#CostCategory">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok#IproKThing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification grouping cost items by their purpose or accounting category.</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">Editorial definition added for proposed IproK 0.2.0; inspect the retained source and mapping record.</dct:description>
    <rdfs:label>CostCategory</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/site#SiteUtilities">
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/SiteUtilities"/>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/site"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/site#SiteIntelligence"/>
    <rdfs:label>Site Utilities</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>OSM grid substation + overhead HT line detection within 200m. The overhead-HT-line-present case is safety-critical and auto-creates a Score 16 risk.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#extractionError">
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated"/>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/extractionError"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>extraction error</rdfs:label>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">Editorial definition added for proposed IproK 0.2.0; inspect the retained source and mapping record.</dct:description>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The extraction error property in the integrated project information model.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/document#issuedTo">
    <rdfs:label>issued to</rdfs:label>
    <dct:source rdf:resource="https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/issuedTo"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Repeatable — the &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok#User&gt;(s) the transmittal is addressed to. SHACL requires sh:minCount 1. Domain unspecified (antipattern #8).</rdfs:comment>
    <dct:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/iprok/document"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#fixedAt">
