    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Name of the containing IfcSpace / IfcBuildingStorey the element belongs to, copied verbatim from the IFC spatial hierarchy. Deliberately distinct from &lt;https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#zone&gt; (V0.23 GPS-haversine zone) — IFC storeys and site GPS zones are orthogonal.</rdfs:comment>
